  (descr "Espressif ESP32-H2-MINI-1 / ESP32-H2-MINI-1-H4S module, 13.2 x 16.6 x 2.4 mm. Land pattern per datasheet v1.6 Figure 11 (page 38): 48 pads 0.4 x 0.8 mm, 4 corner pads 0.7 x 0.7 mm, 5.4 x 5.4 mm thermal pad (pin 49) with 12 thermal vias, paste subdivided 3 x 3 into 1.45 mm windows. The antenna keepout is the 5.4 mm of body at the -Y end; its boundary sits 11.2 mm from the +Y edge. No copper, no FR4 and no ground plane may sit under it. SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0")
  (tags "ESP32-H2 MINI-1 module Thread Zigbee BLE RF SMD")
